```javascript run
const nilai = [80, 92, 67, 75];
console.log(nilai.some((n) => n < 70));
console.log(nilai.every((n) => n >= 60));
console.log(nilai.findIndex((n) => n > 90));
console.log(nilai.findIndex((n) => n > 100));
console.log(nilai.findLast((n) => n >= 75));
```

Hasil di console:

```text
true
true
1
-1
75
```

`findIndex` berguna saat kamu perlu **mengubah** elemen itu di array, misalnya `daftar[i].status = "selesai"`.

